```elixir
fn () ->
  Enum.each(parsed_data, fn x ->
    :pollution_gen_server.add_value("#{x.stationId} #{x.stationName}", x.datetime, x.pollutionType, x.pollutionLevel)
    end)
  end |> :timer.tc |> elem(0)
```

